@MotionPortfolio_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5118

### 1. Yeni Layihə Əlavə Et (POST)
POST {{MotionPortfolio_Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cyberpunk 3D Brand Intro",
  "description": "Futuristic 3D motion graphics made with Cinema4D and Redshift.",
  "videoUrl": "https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/preview/mixkit-futuristic-city-31835-large.mp4",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508739773434-c26b3d09e071",
  "category": "3D Motion"
}

###

### 2. Bütün Layihələri Bazadan Oxu (GET)
GET {{MotionPortfolio_Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects

### 3. Müştəri Sifariş Müraciəti Göndər (POST + RabbitMQ)
POST {{MotionPortfolio_Api_HostAddress}}/api/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Elvin Memmedov",
  "clientEmail": "elvin@example.com",
  "budget": "$1500 - $3000",
  "message": "Brendimiz üçün 30 saniyəlik 3D reklam çarxı hazırlamaq istəyirik."
}

###

### 4. Bütün Müraciətləri Gətir (GET)
GET {{MotionPortfolio_Api_HostAddress}}/api/inquiries

### Layihə 2: 2D Motion Explainer
POST http://localhost:5118/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fintech App Explainer Video",
  "description": "Clean and dynamic 2D vector animation made with After Effects.",
  "videoUrl": "https://commondatastorage.googleapis.com/gtv-videos-bucket/sample/ForBiggerBlazes.mp4",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71",
  "category": "2D Explainer"
}

###

### Layihə 3: 3D Product Commercial
POST http://localhost:5118/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cosmetics 3D Fluid Simulation",
  "description": "High-end product visualization with fluid dynamics in Blender.",
  "videoUrl": "https://commondatastorage.googleapis.com/gtv-videos-bucket/sample/ForBiggerEscapes.mp4",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522335789203-aabd1fc54bc9",
