}
### 5. İlk Admin Hesabını Yarat (POST)
POST {{MotionPortfolio_Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 6. Admin Girişi Et və JWT Token Al (POST)
POST {{MotionPortfolio_Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!"
}